		<path d="M 0.0 85.0 L 2.0 83.8 L 4.0 82.1 L 6.0 80.2 L 8.0 78.2 L 10.0 76.2 L 12.0 74.3 L 14.0 72.3 L 16.0 70.4 L 18.0 68.6 L 20.0 66.9 L 22.0 65.2 L 24.0 63.6 L 26.0 62.1 L 28.0 60.7 L 30.0 59.3 L 32.0 58.0 L 34.0 56.8 L 36.0 55.6 L 38.0 54.5 L 40.0 53.5 L 42.0 52.5 L 44.0 51.6 L 46.0 50.8 L 48.0 50.0 L 50.0 49.2 L 52.0 48.5 L 54.0 47.8 L 56.0 47.2 L 58.0 46.6 L 60.0 46.1 L 62.0 45.5 L 64.0 45.1 L 66.0 44.6 L 68.0 44.2 L 70.0 43.8 L 72.0 43.4 L 74.0 43.1 L 76.0 42.7 L 78.0 42.4 L 80.0 42.1 L 82.0 41.9 L 84.0 41.6 L 86.0 41.4 L 88.0 41.2 L 90.0 41.0 L 92.0 40.8 L 94.0 40.6 L 96.0 40.4 L 98.0 40.3 L 100.0 40.1" />
		<path d="M 0.0 85.0 L 2.0 83.5 L 4.0 81.4 L 6.0 79.0 L 8.0 76.5 L 10.0 74.0 L 12.0 71.5 L 14.0 69.1 L 16.0 66.7 L 18.0 64.5 L 20.0 62.3 L 22.0 60.2 L 24.0 58.2 L 26.0 56.3 L 28.0 54.5 L 30.0 52.7 L 32.0 51.1 L 34.0 49.6 L 36.0 48.1 L 38.0 46.8 L 40.0 45.5 L 42.0 44.3 L 44.0 43.1 L 46.0 42.0 L 48.0 41.0 L 50.0 40.1 L 52.0 39.2 L 54.0 38.3 L 56.0 37.5 L 58.0 36.8 L 60.0 36.1 L 62.0 35.5 L 64.0 34.9 L 66.0 34.3 L 68.0 33.8 L 70.0 33.2 L 72.0 32.8 L 74.0 32.3 L 76.0 31.9 L 78.0 31.5 L 80.0 31.2 L 82.0 30.8 L 84.0 30.5 L 86.0 30.2 L 88.0 30.0 L 90.0 29.7 L 92.0 29.5 L 94.0 29.2 L 96.0 29.0 L 98.0 28.8 L 100.0 28.6" />
		<path d="M 0.0 85.0 L 2.0 83.2 L 4.0 80.7 L 6.0 77.8 L 8.0 74.9 L 10.0 71.9 L 12.0 69.0 L 14.0 66.1 L 16.0 63.3 L 18.0 60.6 L 20.0 58.0 L 22.0 55.5 L 24.0 53.2 L 26.0 50.9 L 28.0 48.8 L 30.0 46.7 L 32.0 44.8 L 34.0 43.0 L 36.0 41.3 L 38.0 39.6 L 40.0 38.1 L 42.0 36.7 L 44.0 35.3 L 46.0 34.0 L 48.0 32.8 L 50.0 31.7 L 52.0 30.6 L 54.0 29.6 L 56.0 28.7 L 58.0 27.8 L 60.0 27.0 L 62.0 26.2 L 64.0 25.5 L 66.0 24.8 L 68.0 24.2 L 70.0 23.6 L 72.0 23.0 L 74.0 22.5 L 76.0 22.0 L 78.0 21.6 L 80.0 21.2 L 82.0 20.8 L 84.0 20.4 L 86.0 20.0 L 88.0 19.7 L 90.0 19.4 L 92.0 19.1 L 94.0 18.8 L 96.0 18.6 L 98.0 18.4 L 100.0 18.1" />
